{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016125453931-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016143222\"/><p>涉案被捕女子。</p><p>元朗區執法人員昨日(15日)於區內展開執法行動，打擊非法使用電動可移動工具。行動中，拘捕一名女子，涉嫌「無牌駕駛」、「駕駛時沒有第三者保險」及「駕駛未獲發牌照的車輛」等罪名。</p><p>執法人員重申，非法駕駛電動可移動工具不僅觸犯法例，更對其他道路使用者及行人構成極大安全威脅。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:40:34.832595+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:54:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:52.670649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:38:10.416674+00:00","content_hash":"800c34d804d28457f25a94939433f71715ba8202b43b3439877d681ee62a3693","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}